                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.532/3: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Portugal</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dearing</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-06-22T12:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 22,
                                1928—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received June 22—10:15
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>25. Department’s instruction number 898, April 11. Minister for Foreign Affairs
                    desires to examine draft treaty. Please send.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dearing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
